        "TileImage": "$($repository 4705ed7e-c3ef-4a0e-aa21-f9d8c498827f).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings, 47.\r\rYour targets are film crew technician Francesco Palerma and Sophia Wilde, the manager of film star Dino Bosco. The pair have orchestrated a months-long blackmail scheme, leveraging illicit footage to siphon millions from Bosco’s estate. Their actions risk both the reputations and lives of Bosco and his peers. They are currently on-set at a film shoot in Sapienza. Make sure they don&apos;t see the results of their production.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
